  "constraints": {
    "maxPerPage": 5,
    "verification": "Checked (minimum observed 2, not expressible in the constraint vocabulary; the per-route counts below are enforced by graph rule CALLOUT_COUNT_PER_ROUTE for the seven routes that share a callout-run template): counts per route are links 2, dating/digital 3, webstore/codapay/distribution/consumer/giftcloud/creator/esim/lms 4, gaming/MoR 5; 0 on / and /pricing/. Callouts of one page are always contiguous (a single run) - never interleaved with other sections; noConsecutive does NOT apply."
